{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"teen-patti UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"teen-patti.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["teen-patti.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Yana amfani da tsari mai kama-da-wani: uku na irin, tsari mai tsarki, tsari, launi, biyu, sa'an nan kuma katin da ya fi girma. A-K-Q yana da matsayi a sama da A-ZXQPH0000QXZ-ZXQPH0001QXZ, wanda aka bi da K-Q-J; wasu tebur na amfani da dokoki daban-daban na gidan. Wannan sigar motsa jiki tana cire dokoki na saka kudi da na kwarewa.","record_id":"ee96ed51741f44066461a58b5674948ff6a3ba36e8028d56399c22864a1a7669","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":2.9452388839999912,"source":"Uses a common comparison order: three of a kind, pure sequence, sequence, color, pair, then high card. A-K-Q ranks above A-2-3, followed by K-Q-J; some tables use different house rules. This practice version removes betting and qualification rules.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"efffbc1e7632c30410b0fc12d4e253a027d99ab3b06d9967fed6d0e814a62a6e","status":"needs-review","translation":"Yana amfani da tsari mai kama-da-wani: uku na irin, tsari mai tsarki, tsari, launi, biyu, sa'an nan kuma katin da ya fi girma. A-K-Q yana da matsayi a sama da A-2-3, wanda aka bi da K-Q-J; wasu tebur na amfani da dokoki daban-daban na gidan. Wannan sigar motsa jiki tana cire dokoki na saka kudi da na kwarewa.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
